      "value": 0.00001,
      "unit": "A",
      "conditions": {
        "note": "the last displayed digit, 2 A range"
      },
      "source": {
        "note": "10 µA, which is a thousand times finer than the 100 A jaw and is what a small core and a tighter window buy."
      },
