    "availability": {
      "en": "The same instrument in every way that touches the circuit — which is none of them — and a different instrument in the only way that matters here. Ten microamps of resolution and a floor at a hundred: fit it in place of the 100 A jaw and the branch that was reading nothing reads a number, while the circuit underneath does not move by so much as a digit."
    }
